DPO isn't in nanochat, but it's built from exactly the same pieces.

1170
01:17:21,354 --> 01:17:27,951
The real thing pretrains its own base model, whose size you pick with one depth parameter,

1171
01:17:27,951 --> 01:17:34,402
it uses the Muon optimizer, bfloat16, eight GPUs with data parallel, and in nanochat, RL

1172
01:17:34,402 --> 01:17:35,648
is done on GSM8K.

1173
01:17:35,648 --> 01:17:38,726
